# Line-ending policy.
#
# The working tree of this repository was checked out on Windows, so most of the
# files that were already tracked (LICENSE, src/*.asm, wiki/*.md, Scripts/*,
# Build/*) sit here with CRLF while the repository stores LF.  Without this file
# `git status` reports all of them as modified and a careless `git add -A` would
# commit an empty 25,000-line rewrite.  `text=auto` makes git normalise line
# endings on the way in, so only real changes show up.
* text=auto

# Real binaries: never touch their bytes.
*.EXE   binary
*.exe   binary
*.bin   binary
*.nes   binary
*.png   binary
*.dll   binary
*.lib   binary
*.pdb   binary
*.zip   binary
